  "worked_solution": "If the ratio of chocolate chip cookies to total cookies is $8:10,$ it means that there are $8$ chocolate chip cookies for every $10$ cookies in total.\n\nAnother way of writing this is to say that \"out of every $10$ cookies in the shop, $8$ of them are chocolate chip.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
